            "kind": "REWORK",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "architecture/code-update/code-update.md",
                    "line": 16,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Lei YU",
                        "email": "mine260309@gmail.com",
                        "username": "mine260309"
                    },
                    "message": "This blank line is preferable by `markdownlint`, removing this breaks:\n\nhttps://github.com/DavidAnson/markdownlint/blob/v0.38.0/doc/md032.md"
                },
                {
                    "file": "architecture/code-update/code-update.md",
                    "line": 16,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Lei YU",
                        "email": "mine260309@gmail.com",
                        "username": "mine260309"
                    },
                    "message": "There is open issue:\n\nhttps://github.com/prettier/prettier/issues/17690\n\nPossibly better to specify prettier to an earlier version until it's fixed."
                },
                {
                    "file": "architecture/code-update/code-update.md",
                    "line": 16,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Prettier 3.6.2 includes this fix and was released late last week."
                },
                {
                    "file": "architecture/code-update/code-update.md",
                    "line": 16,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Lei YU",
                        "email": "mine260309@gmail.com",
                        "username": "mine260309"
                    },
                    "message": "3.6.2 fixes the issue related to \"list after code block\", but not for this case."
                },
                {
                    "file": "architecture/code-update/code-update.md",
                    "line": 16,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "I've ran with the following version mix and do not see any issue:\n\n```\n    Running markdownlint (0.45.0)\n    Running prettier (3.6.2)\n```\n\nThis also appears to be the same version mix that we are running in CI.\n\nCan you tell me which version you are seeing issues with?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "architecture/code-update/code-update.md",
                    "line": 16,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Lei YU",
                        "email": "mine260309@gmail.com",
                        "username": "mine260309"
                    },
                    "message": "OK, markdownlint works for both versions.\n\nIt looks like `MD032/blanks-around-lists` only detects the lists around texts. But if the lists are nested, it's OK for with or without blank lines."
                }
            ],
